Subject: BananaDS: preserve tested configurable controls and centered stick mapping

Keep the input.<button> mappings, hotkey descriptions and radial stick d-pad
conversion present in the tested Duo firmware when rebuilding from the pinned
BananaDS revision. This changes the bundled OS emulator, not game/app files.

--- a/bananads/src/frontend_kms.cpp
+++ b/bananads/src/frontend_kms.cpp
